  on Wednesday\, November 18 lets participants make three small pieces to 
 be bisque fired ahead of time.\nPrice: from $150\nArea: Mobile & Baldwin 
 County\nTimes: Saturday 11/21 · 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM\nChecked against the 
